  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nadi Flood Alleviation Project (NFAP) - Fiji - Climate</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nadi Flood Alleviation Project provides technical advice on flood alleviation in Fiji&#x2019;s economic hub. The first component (Component B) is technical assistance to undertake a review of structural options. This draws on new high-resolution data combined with Australian flood modelling to propose to the Fijian government a package of high impact infrastructure works. The second component (Component C) proposes watershed management and early warning systems to address residual flood risk.</narrative>
  </description>
